  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "One of the first open agentic frameworks for multi-step clinical CXR reasoning — orchestrates 7 specialist models dynamically rather than relying on a single model. ICML 2025, 1.2k stars, Apache-2.0. Caveats: uses GPT-4o as the default backbone (commercial dependency), no versioned releases, and the agentic pattern is still early-stage in clinical radiology. Assess until the framework proves stable and backbone-agnostic deployments are validated.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-18",
